 (284019,"joined (lavah)","v8: 'Assyria also has JOINED (lavah) them' - the confederate roll, the added ally. Standalone."),
 (284022,"arm (zeroa)","v8: 'they are the ARM (zeroa) of the children of Lot' - the strength lent to the alliance, image. Standalone."),
 (306940,"river / wadi (nachal)","v9: 'as you did... at the RIVER (nachal) Kishon' - the site of Sisera's defeat. Standalone."),
