 (283953,"nobles (nadib)","v11: 'Make their NOBLES (nadib) like Oreb and Zeeb' - the enemy chiefs. Standalone."),
 (283958,"princes (nasik)","v11: 'all their PRINCES (nasik) like Zebah and Zalmunna' - the enemy leaders. Standalone."),
 (306948,"possession (yarash)","v12: 'who said, Let us take POSSESSION (yarash) of the pastures of God' - the foes' land-grab intent, quoted. Standalone."),
 (306954,"whirling dust (galgal)","v13: 'Make them like WHIRLING DUST (galgal)' - the tumbleweed, image of scattering. Standalone."),
